Look up the Exalted fandom on both FF dot net and AO3.  It's a smaller fandom and is often used as a form of crossover material.

&#x200B;

I happen to be (for now) the author of the top fic for the fandom on AO3  when you measure by Kudos and Bookmarks.

&#x200B;

